        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Rumored presidential nominees' past legislative proposals are relevant indicators of their future policy priorities.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "Congressional legislation proposing conservation targets reflects credible commitment to environmental protection.",
